{"name": "Slumbering Woods", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"234\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/7b4670f776dfcf150669233ff30434b8.poster.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/7b4670f776dfcf150669233ff30434b8.webm?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/7b4670f776dfcf150669233ff30434b8.mp4?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras_big/4af7b805be40c1e0e15c998c6fd31c39.webp?t=1786572403\" height=\"168\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/4af7b805be40c1e0e15c998c6fd31c39.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slumbering Woods</strong> is a peaceful mushroom-planting exploration adventure where planting\u00a0 mushrooms solves puzzles and opens pathways! After a violent storm separates you from your travelling companions, you wake in a remote village being overtaken by strange fungal growth. To continue your journey, you help the villagers restore their settlement, earning access to their knowledge and friendship, tools to craft, and the hidden paths that lead deeper into the fungal forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the heart of the game is planting as puzzle-solving. Plant mushrooms, study their effects and discover new species as you explore deeper into the forest. Use mushrooms to clear routes, climb obstacles, even traverse water - and don\u2019t forget which ones you can eat!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Note</i></strong><i>: The demo is an <strong>early preview</strong> of Slumbering Woods. The game is still in active development and features, visuals, and balance will change.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Shape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> </strong>Shape the village, discover new plants, and <strong>craft your own</strong> little corner of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/79a90c6c5b201dcd9ae9e8a75d6f4e24.poster.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/79a90c6c5b201dcd9ae9e8a75d6f4e24.webm?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/79a90c6c5b201dcd9ae9e8a75d6f4e24.mp4?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Socialise</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Socialise with your newfound <strong>forest friends</strong> and embroil yourself in their daily gossip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/d381e64f021d76979d1f55066acddef7.poster.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/d381e64f021d76979d1f55066acddef7.webm?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/d381e64f021d76979d1f55066acddef7.mp4?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve <strong>unique puzzles</strong> using mushroom planting to explore the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/58fc5cde36f7901fc25a5942d45c25b3.poster.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/58fc5cde36f7901fc25a5942d45c25b3.webm?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/58fc5cde36f7901fc25a5942d45c25b3.mp4?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather resources to craft tools and materials with the help of the village\u2019s skilled inhabitants.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/257219537b3d67d5d853770d399e30d2.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Switch</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switch between a <strong>day/night cycle</strong> that reveals new secrets with the passing of time.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/dc98228a1bb9528a5baf7c56b0e34d7e.poster.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/dc98228a1bb9528a5baf7c56b0e34d7e.webm?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/dc98228a1bb9528a5baf7c56b0e34d7e.mp4?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore dangerous but beautiful mushroom wilderness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"The scene takes place at night in a quiet forest clearing. The protagonist stands beside several giant mushrooms that tower above them. The mushrooms release soft, glowing spores that drift slowly down through the dark air, lighting the space with a gentle, natural glow. On the opposite side of the scene, a small campfire burns steadily, casting warm orange light that contrasts with the cool, luminous spores. The atmosphere feels calm, sheltered, and slightly magical.\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"338\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/2a1153921086eb32ff7bc22e2cb888fa.poster.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1000\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/2a1153921086eb32ff7bc22e2cb888fa.webm?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/2a1153921086eb32ff7bc22e2cb888fa.mp4?t=1786572403\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find hidden mushrooms and learn how to grow them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3243350/extras/46cc0cc824407b8ec31e1e104a277a22.avif?t=1786572403\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Adventure into the fantastical fungal forest! Plant mushrooms to solve puzzles and open new paths. Discover new species, craft unique items, and restore the land to earn the friendships of its inhabitants.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.